     1472     (input  v-host-code
     1473     ,output v-base-code
     1474     )  .
     1475   find last buf_curr-accnt no-lock
     1476       where buf_curr-accnt.curr-code = v-base-code
     1477         and buf_curr-accnt.exch-date <= v-today use-index pi
     1478   no-error.
